  "prefLabel": "Cor 302.02 Guidance",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Cor 302.02 Guidance. Re-entry programs shall be provided that include vocational testing and counseling. Re-entry classes shall assist in preparing persons under departmental control for parole or unsupervised release and prepare persons under departmental control to seek and hold jobs upon their release.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Cor 300) #12502, eff 3-23-18",
